  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Among the miniature nine heavens, Mini Red Heaven holds a large number of year beasts and an immemorial year monkey.",
      "chapters": [
        1461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s time path clone feeds year beast communities in Mini Red Heaven. Seven year beast communities live there, including immemorial year beasts among them.",
      "chapters": [
        1609
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "year-beast-communities",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mini Red Heaven is fire based, so Fang Yuan places fire path resources there.",
      "chapters": [
        2109
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-plain-resources",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After annexing Fire Plain grotto-heaven, he moves most of that grotto-heaven’s resources into Mini Red Heaven. The layer is almost full, and the sovereign immortal aperture feels packed.",
      "chapters": [
        2108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-plain-resources",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_fire_plain_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fire rain often appears in Mini Red Heaven, and after fire path dao marks increase, it becomes much more frequent. One huge fire rain grows, shoots through a charcoal lake, and becomes rank six meteor rain before strengthening further as it crosses other mini heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        2127
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-rain-disaster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The meteor calamity that threatens Ni clan begins as a spurt of fire rain in Mini Red Heaven. After Fang Yuan annexes Fire Plain grotto-heaven, the surge in fire path dao marks causes frequent fire rain there. One spell keeps growing, merges with a charcoal lake’s dao marks into meteor rain, and rises in power as it passes through other mini heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        2140
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "meteor-calamity-source",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ni_clan"
      ]
    }
